        "original_id": "c7d25218-44db-57be-a8b8-b31412b2a15d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Santana, Rob Thomas\n- Organizations: The Calling, Billboard\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Products: \"Wherever You Will Go\", \"Smooth\"\n- Topics: chart performance, band identity\n\nFacts:\n- The Calling was an American rock band from Los Angeles, California.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" was the debut single by the American band The Calling.\n- The Calling was best known for its hit single \"Wherever You Will Go\".\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" was The Calling's most renowned and most successful hit.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" peaked at number 5 on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" topped the Adult Top 40 chart for 23 weeks.\n- \"Wherever You Will Go\" had the second-longest run at number one in Adult Top 40 history, behind \"Smooth\" by Santana and Rob Thomas.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
